      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.28,
      "end_seconds": 5.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Hi, sit anywhere you like. Where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.93,
      "end_seconds": 11.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "um, so... trouble passing urine that's why I came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.07,
      "end_seconds": 15.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "let's start with the basic checks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.06,
      "end_seconds": 26.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.19,
      "end_seconds": 49.43,
      "duration_seconds": 12.24,
      "text": "okay: temperature 36.6, pressure 108 over 80, pulse 67. And oxygen saturation is 98 percent, respiratory rate 18. How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.08,
      "end_seconds": 52.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Probably four weeks. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.31,
      "end_seconds": 57.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.36,
      "end_seconds": 63.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Moderate, really i've also had weakness in both legs"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.8,
      "end_seconds": 85.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "let me check a few things. Any fever or recent fall?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.23,
      "end_seconds": 91.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "no, you know, not a single one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.55,
      "end_seconds": 95.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.02,
      "end_seconds": 98.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.33,
      "end_seconds": 103.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.46,
      "end_seconds": 107.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "no, nothing with my heart"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.43,
      "end_seconds": 126.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.76,
      "end_seconds": 131.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "No, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.85,
      "end_seconds": 133.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.53,
      "end_seconds": 136.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.3,
      "end_seconds": 140.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.57,
      "end_seconds": 142.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "no, never"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.53,
      "end_seconds": 158.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.97,
      "end_seconds": 164.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.73,
      "end_seconds": 172.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.36,
      "end_seconds": 177.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.74,
      "end_seconds": 185.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.59,
      "end_seconds": 188.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "my mother had a stroke"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.37,
      "end_seconds": 196.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.68,
      "end_seconds": 201.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "no, nothing I can think of"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.87,
      "end_seconds": 206.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.08,
      "end_seconds": 219.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.36,
      "end_seconds": 224.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.49,
      "end_seconds": 242.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "You have numbness in the saddle area and your leg strength is reduced."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.45,
      "end_seconds": 257.0,
      "duration_seconds": 8.55,
      "text": "okay, all finished, thank you. Okay, thinking it through, this is probably possible cauda equina syndrome needing an urgent scan"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.79,
      "end_seconds": 260.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.93,
      "end_seconds": 292.93,
      "duration_seconds": 27.0,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's possible cauda equina syndrome needing an urgent scan, and we'll know more once the an urgent MRI of the spine is back. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had trouble passing urine for four weeks, moderate, and no recent fall or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.59,
      "end_seconds": 295.29,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.58,
      "end_seconds": 301.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "let's get an urgent MRI of the spine, for possible cauda equina"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 303.04,
      "end_seconds": 306.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "I can book that for Thursday at 10 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.1,
      "end_seconds": 326.58,
      "duration_seconds": 18.48,
      "text": "You need to go to hospital now for an emergency scan. If the numbness spreads, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department. I'll want another look straight away. Okay, is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.86,
      "end_seconds": 334.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "okay, that makes sense thanks for explaining"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.81,
      "end_seconds": 336.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
